# Sensitive local documents & credentials
# NOTE: ha_access_instructions.md previously lived in this directory containing a live
# Home Assistant long-lived token and SSH root details. It has been moved OUT of the repo
# tree entirely -- a gitignore entry is a backstop, not a place to keep secrets.
ha_access_instructions.md
*.env
*.private.json
local.keystore.properties
keystore.properties

# Local marketing materials & video recordings
marketing/
